// Series 65 (Uniform Investment Adviser Law Examination) — practice question bank
// Same quiz-item shape as data/curriculum.js lesson quizzes: {q, a, explanation, options:[{text, explanation}]}
// plus an id and a section tag mapping to the four blueprint sections in series65.js's SERIES65_META.
//
// section values: "economic" | "vehicles" | "client" | "laws"
// Distribution targets blueprint weight: economic ~15%, vehicles ~25%, client ~30%, laws ~30%.
//
// 520 questions: economic 80, vehicles 128, client 156, laws 156. Sized so FOUR full
// 130-question mocks can be drawn on-blueprint without the bank running out of a section
// (each section holds >= 4x its per-form quota of 20/32/39/39). At the original 300 the bank
// carried only 2.25 distinct forms, so a third mock was largely recycled and a remembered
// answer scored like a known one.
//
// The first 300 items are the original bank and are kept first and unchanged; the rest are
// composed from the per-section files below so each section stays independently reviewable.

