    explanation: "Authorized participants can exchange baskets of the underlying securities for large blocks (creation units) of ETF shares, and vice versa. This in-kind creation/redemption mechanism enables arbitrage that corrects pricing gaps and keeps the ETF's market price closely aligned with its NAV.",
